    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574350/extras/916809f7b867171355c3224b44d57cc4.avif?t=1753439415\" width=439 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Speedin' Shotgun is a fast paced precise platformer where you use only one-button to play.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With inspiration from other precise platformers, Speedin' Shotgun has it's own unique take on the platformer genre. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game was built from the ground up with speed-running in mind, containing useful features that speed-runners alike will enjoy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fast paced gameplay!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574350/extras/8e41d37f0d3f114cd73274bca51f8bc4.poster.avif?t=1753439415\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574350/extras/8e41d37f0d3f114cd73274bca51f8bc4.webm?t=1753439415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574350/extras/8e41d37f0d3f114cd73274bca51f8bc4.mp4?t=1753439415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A comprehensive map editor! (With Steam Workshop Support!)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574350/extras/cf0ff10239b6c866698e0d15a1613195.poster.avif?t=1753439415\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574350/extras/cf0ff10239b6c866698e0d15a1613195.webm?t=1753439415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574350/extras/cf0ff10239b6c866698e0d15a1613195.mp4?t=1753439415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574350/extras/916809f7b867171355c3224b44d57cc4.avif?t=1753439415\" width=439 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Speedin' Shotgun is a fast paced precise platformer where you use only one-button to play.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With inspiration from other precise platformers, Speedin' Shotgun has it's own unique take on the platformer genre. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game was built from the ground up with speed-running in mind, containing useful features that speed-runners alike will enjoy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fast paced gameplay!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574350/extras/8e41d37f0d3f114cd73274bca51f8bc4.poster.avif?t=1753439415\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574350/extras/8e41d37f0d3f114cd73274bca51f8bc4.webm?t=1753439415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574350/extras/8e41d37f0d3f114cd73274bca51f8bc4.mp4?t=1753439415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A comprehensive map editor! (With Steam Workshop Support!)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574350/extras/cf0ff10239b6c866698e0d15a1613195.poster.avif?t=1753439415\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574350/extras/cf0ff10239b6c866698e0d15a1613195.webm?t=1753439415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574350/extras/cf0ff10239b6c866698e0d15a1613195.mp4?t=1753439415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
